# Kaheera, the Orphanguard: "Companion - Each creature card in your starting deck is a Cat, Elemental, Nightmare, Dinosaur, or
# Beast card" (CR 702.139a). Bot1's creature cards are one of each type (a Cat Soldier, an Elemental Raccoon, a Nightmare, a
# Dinosaur, a Beast), each qualifying by one of the five types; its lands and Lightning Bolt are no creature cards, so they need no
# type. Both chose Kaheera as their companion: Bot1's is revealed before the game (CR 103.2b); Bot2's Hired Blade (a Human
# Assassin) is none of the types, so Bot2's stays a sideboard card even though its other creature is a Cat.

[Bot1 Deck]
Solarium Sentry
Bramble Familiar
Fiend Artisan
Rampaging Ferocidon
Loot, the Nexus
Lightning Bolt
Forest x21

[Bot1 Companion]
Kaheera, the Orphanguard

[Bot2 Deck]
